| Pulled Reward | Target Database | Row Key | Target Sub-Game |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **🧬 Purple DNA (300–3,000)** | `arc_jurassic/resources.db` | `dna` | Arc Jurassic Nursery & Dinosaur Synthesis |
| **🔴 Red DNA Orbs (x1–3)** | `arc_jurassic/resources.db` | `red_orbs` | Arc Jurassic Super-Hybrids & Bosses |
| **⏳ Game Time (1H–3D)** | `arc_jurassic/resources.db` | `jurassic_time` | Arc Jurassic Temporal Incubation & Acceleration |
| **🪽 Vinyl Stems (0.3%)** | `golden_hour/vault.json` | `vault` | Sovereign Archive for Future Projects |
| **💽 Disc Cost (100 Discs)** | `golden_hour/inventory.db` & `vinyl_angel` | `discs` | Vinyl Angel Harmonic Player Balance |

---

